1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,610
Read a funny A1 story about trying something new.

2
00:00:03,610 --> 00:00:10,429
Follow the story scenes, answer simple questions, and then act the gym role play with a partner.

3
00:00:10,429 --> 00:00:12,836
This is a short school story.

4
00:00:12,836 --> 00:00:16,045
Mr. Ping Pong is good at table tennis.

5
00:00:16,045 --> 00:00:20,056
He likes to win, and he talks like a champion.

6
00:00:20,056 --> 00:00:24,067
But one day, the class uses a big jump rope.

7
00:00:24,067 --> 00:00:29,281
Mr. Ping Pong learns that a new thing can be hard at first.

8
00:00:29,281 --> 00:00:30,886
Read each scene first.

9
00:00:30,886 --> 00:00:36,903
When you see the role play, choose two roles and act it with a partner.

10
00:00:36,903 --> 00:00:40,112
What sport or game are you good at?

11
00:00:40,112 --> 00:00:44,925
Is it easy to try a new thing in front of people?

12
00:00:44,925 --> 00:00:48,535
What can you say when a friend needs help?

13
00:00:48,535 --> 00:00:51,343
Mr. Ping Pong is famous at school.

14
00:00:51,343 --> 00:00:54,151
He is very good at table tennis.

15
00:00:54,151 --> 00:00:58,162
Every day, he carries his racket bag like a champion.

16
00:00:58,162 --> 00:00:59,766
He says, "Move, please.

17
00:00:59,766 --> 00:01:01,371
A champion is coming."

18
00:01:01,371 --> 00:01:02,574
Some students laugh.

19
00:01:02,574 --> 00:01:04,981
Some students think he is rude.

20
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:08,190
Mr. Ping Pong wants to win every game.

21
00:01:08,190 --> 00:01:10,195
When he wins, he smiles.

22
00:01:10,195 --> 00:01:15,811
When he loses, he says, "The floor is bad," or "The ball is strange.

23
00:01:15,811 --> 00:01:19,822
He does not like to say, "You played well.

24
00:01:19,822 --> 00:01:23,031
On Friday, the class goes to the gym.

25
00:01:23,031 --> 00:01:26,240
The teacher has a very long jump rope.

26
00:01:26,240 --> 00:01:29,850
Two students hold the rope and turn it slowly.

27
00:01:29,850 --> 00:01:30,550
Whoosh.

28
00:01:30,550 --> 00:01:31,250
Whoosh.

29
00:01:31,250 --> 00:01:31,950
Whoosh.

30
00:01:31,950 --> 00:01:33,554
Some students are excited.

31
00:01:33,554 --> 00:01:35,159
Some students are nervous.

32
00:01:35,159 --> 00:01:36,763
Mr. Ping Pong laughs.

33
00:01:36,763 --> 00:01:38,769
He says, "This is easy.

34
00:01:38,769 --> 00:01:40,774
It is only a rope.

35
00:01:40,774 --> 00:01:43,983
A quiet student named Haru looks at him.

36
00:01:43,983 --> 00:01:47,192
Haru says, "Big jump rope needs timing too.

37
00:01:47,192 --> 00:01:49,599
Mr. Ping Pong crosses his arms.

38
00:01:49,599 --> 00:01:52,407
He says, "Timing is my best friend.

39
00:01:52,407 --> 00:01:56,017
The teacher smiles and says, "Okay, Mr. Ping Pong.

40
00:01:56,017 --> 00:01:57,621
You can try first.

41
00:01:57,621 --> 00:01:58,825
The rope turns.

42
00:01:58,825 --> 00:01:59,525
Whoosh.

43
00:01:59,525 --> 00:02:00,225
Whoosh.

44
00:02:00,225 --> 00:02:00,925
Whoosh.

45
00:02:00,925 --> 00:02:03,733
Mr. Ping Pong stands near the rope.

46
00:02:03,733 --> 00:02:07,744
He wants to jump in, but the rope looks fast.

47
00:02:07,744 --> 00:02:08,947
Then he jumps.

48
00:02:08,947 --> 00:02:09,647
Smack.

49
00:02:09,647 --> 00:02:12,455
The rope hits his foot and stops.

50
00:02:12,455 --> 00:02:13,658
Some students laugh.

51
00:02:13,658 --> 00:02:16,065
Mr. Ping Pong's face is red.

52
00:02:16,065 --> 00:02:18,873
He says, "The rope is too low.

53
00:02:18,873 --> 00:02:20,076
He tries again.

54
00:02:20,076 --> 00:02:22,483
This time, he waits too long.

55
00:02:22,483 --> 00:02:24,488
The rope hits his back.

56
00:02:24,488 --> 00:02:25,188
Smack.

57
00:02:25,188 --> 00:02:27,194
Now the gym is quiet.

58
00:02:27,194 --> 00:02:29,199
Mr. Ping Pong is angry.

59
00:02:29,199 --> 00:02:31,606
He says, "This rope is stupid.

60
00:02:31,606 --> 00:02:34,013
Table tennis is a real sport.

61
00:02:34,013 --> 00:02:35,216
Haru walks closer.

62
00:02:35,216 --> 00:02:40,431
Haru says, "You do not have to be perfect on the first try.

63
00:02:40,431 --> 00:02:42,436
Mr. Ping Pong looks away.

64
00:02:42,436 --> 00:02:45,645
He is not angry only at the rope.

65
00:02:45,645 --> 00:02:47,250
He is scared too.

66
00:02:47,250 --> 00:02:49,656
He is scared to look weak.

67
00:02:49,656 --> 00:02:54,069
He is scared that people will not think he is special.

68
00:02:54,069 --> 00:02:56,475
The teacher says, "Watch the rope.

69
00:02:56,475 --> 00:02:58,080
Listen to the beat.

70
00:02:58,080 --> 00:02:59,684
The rope turns again.

71
00:02:59,684 --> 00:03:00,384
Whoosh.

72
00:03:00,384 --> 00:03:01,084
Step.

73
00:03:01,084 --> 00:03:01,784
Whoosh.

74
00:03:01,784 --> 00:03:02,484
Step.

75
00:03:02,484 --> 00:03:03,184
Whoosh.

76
00:03:03,184 --> 00:03:03,884
Step.

77
00:03:03,884 --> 00:03:05,489
Mr. Ping Pong watches.

78
00:03:05,489 --> 00:03:06,291
He listens.

79
00:03:06,291 --> 00:03:08,297
The rope is like music.

80
00:03:08,297 --> 00:03:12,308
In table tennis, he also waits for the right time.

81
00:03:12,308 --> 00:03:15,116
Maybe the big rope is not stupid.

82
00:03:15,116 --> 00:03:18,324
Mr. Ping Pong says quietly, "One more try.

83
00:03:18,324 --> 00:03:21,132
This time, he does not talk loudly.

84
00:03:21,132 --> 00:03:22,737
He watches the rope.

85
00:03:22,737 --> 00:03:24,742
His feet move a little.

86
00:03:24,742 --> 00:03:25,946
Haru says, "Now.

87
00:03:25,946 --> 00:03:27,951
Mr. Ping Pong steps in.

88
00:03:27,951 --> 00:03:28,651
Jump.

89
00:03:28,651 --> 00:03:31,058
The rope goes under his feet.

90
00:03:31,058 --> 00:03:31,758
Jump.

91
00:03:31,758 --> 00:03:34,165
It goes under his feet again.

92
00:03:34,165 --> 00:03:36,170
The students clap and count.

93
00:03:36,170 --> 00:03:36,870
"One!

94
00:03:36,870 --> 00:03:37,570
Two!

95
00:03:37,570 --> 00:03:38,270
Three!

96
00:03:38,270 --> 00:03:38,970
Four!

97
00:03:38,970 --> 00:03:42,179
Then Haru throws a soft table tennis ball.

98
00:03:42,179 --> 00:03:46,992
Mr. Ping Pong jumps and taps the ball back with his racket.

99
00:03:46,992 --> 00:03:47,692
Tap.

100
00:03:47,692 --> 00:03:48,896
Everyone says, "Wow!

101
00:03:48,896 --> 00:03:52,105
Mr. Ping Pong runs out of the rope.

102
00:03:52,105 --> 00:03:54,511
He is tired, but he smiles.

103
00:03:54,511 --> 00:03:57,720
He says, "Big jump rope is not stupid.

104
00:03:57,720 --> 00:04:00,929
It needs rhythm, timing, practice, and maybe help.

105
00:04:00,929 --> 00:04:03,336
Two students act the gym scene.

106
00:04:03,336 --> 00:04:04,940
One student is Haru.

107
00:04:04,940 --> 00:04:07,347
One student is Mr. Ping Pong.

108
00:04:07,347 --> 00:04:08,551
Read the lines.

109
00:04:08,551 --> 00:04:10,155
Then change one detail.

110
00:04:10,155 --> 00:04:10,957
Gym practice:

111
00:04:10,957 --> 00:04:12,562
Haru: Are you ready?

112
00:04:12,562 --> 00:04:14,166
Mr. Ping Pong: Yes.

113
00:04:14,166 --> 00:04:15,771
I can do this.

114
00:04:15,771 --> 00:04:17,375
Haru: Watch the rope.

115
00:04:17,375 --> 00:04:18,980
Listen to the beat.

116
00:04:18,980 --> 00:04:21,386
Mr. Ping Pong: It looks fast.

117
00:04:21,386 --> 00:04:22,991
Haru: Do not rush.

118
00:04:22,991 --> 00:04:23,691
Wait.

119
00:04:23,691 --> 00:04:25,295
Mr. Ping Pong: Okay.

120
00:04:25,295 --> 00:04:26,498
Tell me when.

121
00:04:26,498 --> 00:04:27,301
Haru: Now.

122
00:04:27,301 --> 00:04:28,905
Mr. Ping Pong: Jump.

123
00:04:28,905 --> 00:04:30,109
I did it!

124
00:04:30,109 --> 00:04:31,312
Haru: Good job.

125
00:04:31,312 --> 00:04:32,916
Try two more jumps.

126
00:04:32,916 --> 00:04:34,521
Mr. Ping Pong: One.

127
00:04:34,521 --> 00:04:35,221
Two.

128
00:04:35,221 --> 00:04:38,029
This is hard, but it is fun.

129
00:04:38,029 --> 00:04:40,836
Haru: Do you want the ball too?

130
00:04:40,836 --> 00:04:42,441
Mr. Ping Pong: Yes.

131
00:04:42,441 --> 00:04:44,045
Throw it softly, please.

132
00:04:44,045 --> 00:04:45,650
Haru: Here it comes.

133
00:04:45,650 --> 00:04:47,254
Mr. Ping Pong: Tap.

134
00:04:47,254 --> 00:04:47,954
Wow.

135
00:04:47,954 --> 00:04:49,960
I can jump and hit.

136
00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:51,965
Haru: You have good timing.

137
00:04:51,965 --> 00:04:53,971
Mr. Ping Pong: Thank you.

138
00:04:53,971 --> 00:04:55,977
Your help was good too.

139
00:04:55,977 --> 00:04:59,186
What sport is Mr. Ping Pong good at?

140
00:04:59,186 --> 00:05:01,592
He is good at table tennis.

141
00:05:01,592 --> 00:05:05,202
What can a good winner say after a game?

142
00:05:05,202 --> 00:05:08,411
What does Haru say the big rope needs?

143
00:05:08,411 --> 00:05:10,417
Haru says it needs timing.

144
00:05:10,417 --> 00:05:14,027
What new activity is hard for you at first?

145
00:05:14,027 --> 00:05:17,637
What happens when Mr. Ping Pong tries two times?

146
00:05:17,637 --> 00:05:22,049
The rope hits his foot, and then it hits his back.

147
00:05:22,049 --> 00:05:24,857
What can people say after a mistake?

148
00:05:24,857 --> 00:05:28,868
What does the teacher tell Mr. Ping Pong to do?

149
00:05:28,868 --> 00:05:34,083
The teacher tells him to watch the rope and listen to the beat.

150
00:05:34,083 --> 00:05:36,890
Who helps you when you feel nervous?

151
00:05:36,890 --> 00:05:39,297
What does Mr. Ping Pong learn?

152
00:05:39,297 --> 00:05:44,110
He learns that big jump rope needs rhythm, timing, practice, and help.

153
00:05:44,110 --> 00:05:47,721
What do you want to practice little by little?

154
00:05:47,721 --> 00:05:51,331
What does Haru tell Mr. Ping Pong to do?

155
00:05:51,331 --> 00:05:56,545
Haru tells him to watch the rope, listen to the beat, and wait.

156
00:05:56,545 --> 00:05:58,150
Practice the gym scene.

157
00:05:58,150 --> 00:06:02,562
Then change the sport, the number of jumps, or the helper.

158
00:06:02,562 --> 00:06:06,172
Mr. Ping Pong is proud, funny, and sometimes difficult.

159
00:06:06,172 --> 00:06:08,579
But he can change a little.

160
00:06:08,579 --> 00:06:11,787
At first, he laughs at the big rope.

161
00:06:11,787 --> 00:06:15,398
Then he misses, listens, tries again, and accepts help.

162
00:06:15,398 --> 00:06:23,019
The story teaches a simple lesson: a new thing can feel scary, but practice and help make it easier.

163
00:06:23,019 --> 00:06:27,431
You do not have to be perfect on the first try.
